kgx-compact (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Removes the GNOME Console title bar and replaces the header bar with a
      compact tab strip, via a G_RESOURCE_OVERLAYS replacement of
      /org/gnome/Console/kgx-window.ui.
    - The overlay is generated from the pristine upstream template by
      tools/kgx-patch.py, and every edit asserts the structure it expects, so a
      Console release that moves things causes a loud refusal rather than a
      silently wrong window.
    - Verifies the overlay type-checks against GTK4/libadwaita and that the
      stylesheet both parses and matches real widgets.

 -- tongtf <tongtf@qq.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
